From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kbutala <kbutala@nvidia.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 10:44:21 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] NVIDIA: SAUCE: apparmor/Kconfig: Fix warning and a typo

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2161703

While building the kernel, the following warning is emitted:

security/apparmor/Kconfig:120:warning: multi-line strings not supported

Also, a minor typo has been fixed - s/defauit/default.

Bug: https://bugs.launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/linux-nvidia-6.17/+bug/2161703

Signed-off-by: Kaushal Rajeev Butala <kbutala@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Jamie Nguyen <jamien@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Carol L Soto <csoto@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Nirmoy Das <nirmoyd@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Brad Figg <bfigg@nvidia.com>
Ledger-Change: C-01800
Ledger-Origin: nvidia-bos@548509a103525b784cc936dd1aadcec38f9aeeb8
---
 security/apparmor/Kconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/security/apparmor/Kconfig b/security/apparmor/Kconfig
index bd0b2380b1d9..7844e8c308ba 100644
--- a/security/apparmor/Kconfig
+++ b/security/apparmor/Kconfig
@@ -117,7 +117,7 @@ config SECURITY_APPARMOR_RESTRICT_USERNS
 	  by their profile.
 
 config SECURITY_APPARMOR_PACKET_MEDIATION_ENABLED
-	bool "Enable AppArmor packet mediation by defauit
+	bool "Enable AppArmor packet mediation by default"
 	depends on SECURITY_APPARMOR && NETWORK_SECMARK
 	default n
 	help
